WEBVTT

00:00:08.080 --> 00:00:09.360
Haimura Moroha.

00:00:09.980 --> 00:00:13.080
I thank you for coming.

00:00:13.460 --> 00:00:17.580
You're the new exchange student from Russia?

00:00:18.080 --> 00:00:19.200
Yes.

00:00:20.630 --> 00:00:23.990
This is the first time we've met, isn't it?

00:00:29.420 --> 00:00:33.590
So the love letter was a trap to lure me out.

00:00:37.950 --> 00:00:43.480
<b>I like you.
I want to talk to you.
I'll be waiting behind Stadium One.
I want to see you now.</b>

00:00:48.450 --> 00:00:50.240
The letter wasn't a trap.

00:00:50.830 --> 00:00:51.740
What?

00:00:52.140 --> 00:00:53.240
I—

00:00:55.630 --> 00:00:56.880
I...

00:00:58.090 --> 00:01:01.540
I fell in love with you 
just now, at first sight.

00:01:05.270 --> 00:01:08.040
Don't fall in love with me 
<i>after</i> you send your letter!

00:01:11.510 --> 00:01:14.660
I'd heard from a reputable source 
that there's a tradition

00:01:14.660 --> 00:01:19.340
in Japan of sending a love 
letter to your crush and

00:01:19.340 --> 00:01:22.380
confessing to them behind the gym.

00:01:22.380 --> 00:01:24.960
But if that wasn't the correct custom...

00:01:23.380 --> 00:01:27.140
I guess we do have a custom like that, but...

00:01:27.580 --> 00:01:31.730
Then my feelings must have 
reached you as they should.

00:01:33.580 --> 00:01:36.650
Let us be in a relationship 
together, Haimura Moroha.

00:01:37.160 --> 00:01:39.600
Are you sure that's the look of love?

00:01:39.600 --> 00:01:41.610
What exactly are you plotting?

00:01:42.030 --> 00:01:44.030
I'm plotting for us to become lovers,

00:01:44.030 --> 00:01:47.640
and for us to go frequently 
on dates together.

00:01:49.140 --> 00:01:50.600
Oh, man.

00:01:51.180 --> 00:01:54.300
Sorry, I don't know you very well.

00:01:54.680 --> 00:01:56.300
I can't go out with you.

00:01:59.610 --> 00:02:00.750
I want to die.

00:02:00.750 --> 00:02:01.540
Huh?

00:02:02.210 --> 00:02:04.990
Haimura Moroha rejected me.

00:02:05.550 --> 00:02:07.140
And now I want to die.

00:02:07.140 --> 00:02:09.100
It doesn't look like you're kidding.

00:02:09.810 --> 00:02:10.870
I'm depressed.

00:02:10.870 --> 00:02:11.610
Time to die.

00:02:12.770 --> 00:02:15.160
Why don't we start by being friends?

00:03:57.940 --> 00:04:00.060
She's so pretty.

00:04:00.060 --> 00:04:04.160
Though there're lots of scary rumors 
about the Russia branch, aren't there?

00:04:08.020 --> 00:04:10.780
My name is Elena Arshavina.

00:04:11.300 --> 00:04:14.140
They called me Lesya at the Russia branch.

00:04:14.470 --> 00:04:17.150
Okay, Elena-san, have a seat over there.

00:04:17.390 --> 00:04:18.860
Me! Me! Me!

00:04:20.530 --> 00:04:22.860
Yes, Ranjou-san?

00:04:24.180 --> 00:04:28.300
Russian people have their dad's 
names in their last names, right?

00:04:28.800 --> 00:04:30.370
Don't you have one, Lesya?

00:04:31.050 --> 00:04:33.620
I don't have parents.

00:04:35.290 --> 00:04:39.680
The name Arshavina is simply the name 
of the facility where I grew up.

00:04:40.830 --> 00:04:44.380
S-Sorry, I...

00:04:45.300 --> 00:04:47.340
There's no need to pity me.

00:04:47.920 --> 00:04:52.890
I have a precious younger brother. 
I'm not entirely alone.

00:04:55.700 --> 00:04:58.020
Urushibara-san.

00:04:59.250 --> 00:05:02.900
Elena-san, what is your objective?

00:05:03.220 --> 00:05:06.410
An investigation? Head hunting? Abduction?

00:05:06.850 --> 00:05:09.240
Or assassination?

00:05:12.520 --> 00:05:14.250
Hey, what'd she just say?

00:05:14.740 --> 00:05:17.000
What's wrong with Urushibara-san?

00:05:17.440 --> 00:05:19.660
Urushibara-san.

00:05:19.660 --> 00:05:23.760
My objective is to be in a 
relationship with Haimura Moroha.

00:05:23.920 --> 00:05:24.760
Huh?

00:05:25.140 --> 00:05:26.760
What?

00:05:27.110 --> 00:05:29.260
How could I allow that?

00:05:30.050 --> 00:05:33.020
Why wouldn't I be allowed?

00:05:33.580 --> 00:05:35.830
I've already made my confession.

00:05:35.830 --> 00:05:37.920
Say what?!

00:05:38.530 --> 00:05:40.770
Hey, what's going, Haimura?

00:05:41.340 --> 00:05:43.650
Foreigners are so assertive.

00:05:44.310 --> 00:05:48.920
How could you mess with Nii-sama 
without my permission?

00:05:49.270 --> 00:05:51.420
Who might you be?

00:05:51.420 --> 00:05:53.020
Ranjou Satsuki.

00:05:53.020 --> 00:05:54.620
Moroha's sister.

00:05:56.120 --> 00:05:59.830
I never knew Haimura Moroha 
had such a cute sister.

00:06:00.200 --> 00:06:01.880
I'm envious.

00:06:01.880 --> 00:06:04.080
Oh, you.

00:06:04.080 --> 00:06:05.990
Stop it, you're embarrassing me.

00:06:05.990 --> 00:06:07.580
I know it's true, but still.

00:06:07.580 --> 00:06:08.530
Ahem.

00:06:09.160 --> 00:06:12.590
I-I'm not here for you to flatter me.

00:06:12.590 --> 00:06:17.390
Listen, if you want to confess to Moroha, 
you have to go through me first.

00:06:17.880 --> 00:06:21.630
Give me your brother, please.

00:06:21.630 --> 00:06:23.870
Thank you for your offer.

00:06:23.870 --> 00:06:27.190
No, that's not the point, you idiot!

00:06:27.560 --> 00:06:30.010
What do you think you're doing?

00:06:30.010 --> 00:06:31.910
B-But...

00:06:32.880 --> 00:06:37.410
Elena-san, what is it about 
Moroha that you like?

00:06:39.620 --> 00:06:41.420
It was love at first sight.

00:06:42.790 --> 00:06:45.420
That's not a real answer!

00:06:45.990 --> 00:06:48.420
Ranjou-san is right.

00:06:48.420 --> 00:06:52.430
If you're really in love, 
you ought to be able to answer.

00:06:53.030 --> 00:06:54.940
What about you, then?

00:06:54.940 --> 00:06:57.430
What do you like about Haimura Moroha?

00:06:59.260 --> 00:07:00.440
Everything.

00:07:01.120 --> 00:07:04.820
I don't think that's a real answer, either.

00:07:08.720 --> 00:07:12.120
Haimura, that bastard, he's globally popular!

00:07:12.120 --> 00:07:13.960
Even more rivals!

00:07:13.960 --> 00:07:15.910
Um, can we start with class?

00:07:16.340 --> 00:07:19.300
How am I supposed to deal with this?

00:07:49.150 --> 00:07:51.020
She deflected it with her boobs!

00:07:51.020 --> 00:07:53.200
No, that was a Kongoutsu.

00:07:54.320 --> 00:07:56.450
What are you, a steel wall?

00:07:56.870 --> 00:08:01.460
Even a mosquito's better at 
kissing than you, Uisuke.

00:08:03.470 --> 00:08:06.980
Sophie-senpai has this won.

00:08:06.980 --> 00:08:08.740
No, not yet.

00:08:08.740 --> 00:08:11.290
Takkie-senpai isn't going down that easily.

00:08:11.290 --> 00:08:15.670
Hey, Moroha, I heard you got confessed to.

00:08:15.670 --> 00:08:17.000
By a transfer student.

00:08:17.000 --> 00:08:19.450
How do you know about that?

00:08:19.450 --> 00:08:22.060
The whole academy knows.

00:08:23.820 --> 00:08:25.560
It's nice being young, isn't it?

00:08:27.340 --> 00:08:28.570
Principal!

00:08:28.970 --> 00:08:31.940
Differences in nationality, 
differences in ethnicity—

00:08:31.940 --> 00:08:36.610
none of that stands in your 
way when you're young.

00:08:37.580 --> 00:08:41.080
Be good to the transfer student, okay?

00:08:42.450 --> 00:08:43.500
Right.

00:08:47.680 --> 00:08:49.420
Wh-What is that?

00:08:52.960 --> 00:08:54.810
Light skill, Keikoku.

00:08:54.810 --> 00:08:57.140
Go, Takkie-senpai, you're awesome!

00:08:59.130 --> 00:09:02.450
I see, nice trap.

00:09:02.450 --> 00:09:03.490
But...

00:09:07.560 --> 00:09:09.070
Wait, stop, Sophie!

00:09:09.070 --> 00:09:10.140
Stop!

00:09:10.140 --> 00:09:13.690
Are you upset because 
your skill was defeated?

00:09:14.460 --> 00:09:16.070
Your bottom! Your bottom!

00:09:16.630 --> 00:09:17.610
My bottom?

00:09:20.460 --> 00:09:22.030
Oh my god.

00:09:26.000 --> 00:09:29.590
Uisuke, you pervert!

00:09:33.470 --> 00:09:35.930
Looks fun.

00:09:35.930 --> 00:09:37.760
Oh, hand pleasure!

00:09:39.500 --> 00:09:43.210
They're so chock full of the American Dream, 
you can't even hide it, can you?

00:09:43.210 --> 00:09:45.820
Your American Cherry is going to fall ou—

00:09:48.870 --> 00:09:50.820
Sorry I'm late.

00:09:50.820 --> 00:09:52.730
Let's begin training.

00:09:55.080 --> 00:09:57.520
I've been waiting for you, Haimura Moroha.

00:09:58.640 --> 00:09:59.870
Lesya.

00:10:01.480 --> 00:10:03.340
What do you want from Moroha?

00:10:03.340 --> 00:10:05.870
You were lurking. How distasteful.

00:10:07.030 --> 00:10:08.870
Haimura Moroha.

00:10:09.500 --> 00:10:12.670
I want you to go on a date with me tomorrow.

00:10:13.880 --> 00:10:16.040
A date?!

00:10:23.810 --> 00:10:25.890
They're both late.

00:10:26.380 --> 00:10:30.730
Why would I allow you to go 
on a date with Moroha alone?

00:10:31.340 --> 00:10:33.170
We're going with you.

00:10:33.170 --> 00:10:34.980
Right, Urushibara?

00:10:34.980 --> 00:10:37.720
Sadly, I have plans tomorrow.

00:10:38.490 --> 00:10:40.530
Ranjou-san, I'm counting on you.

00:10:43.940 --> 00:10:45.990
Jeez. Fine.

00:10:45.990 --> 00:10:48.920
I'll protect him for you, too.

00:10:49.270 --> 00:10:55.590
I will prove to you that I'm the most 
worthy of being Haimura Moroha's lover.

00:11:01.840 --> 00:11:04.110
Kept you waiting, Haimura Moroha.

00:11:04.680 --> 00:11:05.880
Lesya.

00:11:05.880 --> 00:11:07.390
Morni—

00:11:13.130 --> 00:11:16.460
I'm late because I couldn't 
put on my underwear by myself.

00:11:17.420 --> 00:11:19.530
I'm so clumsy.

00:11:22.210 --> 00:11:24.860
I'm so clumsy.

00:11:24.860 --> 00:11:27.260
It's not like I didn't hear you.

00:11:27.260 --> 00:11:29.870
But what's up with the cat ears?

00:11:34.070 --> 00:11:39.720
Is this outfit weird, even to the Japanese?

00:11:40.020 --> 00:11:41.970
Sorry, honestly...

00:11:44.230 --> 00:11:45.250
I'm depressed.

00:11:45.250 --> 00:11:46.100
Time to die.

00:11:46.450 --> 00:11:48.230
Wait!

00:11:48.230 --> 00:11:52.950
I heard Japanese boys are suckers 
for clumsy girls dressed like this.

00:11:53.650 --> 00:11:55.720
I've embarrassed myself.

00:11:55.720 --> 00:11:57.480
Time to die.

00:11:56.110 --> 00:11:57.480
Where did you even hear that?!

00:11:58.120 --> 00:12:05.240
I studied Japanese culture from a reputable 
source in order to become your lover.

00:12:05.520 --> 00:12:07.360
Again, who?!

00:12:07.740 --> 00:12:08.790
<b>Satsuki</b>

00:12:09.090 --> 00:12:11.750
I can't go on the date!

00:12:12.000 --> 00:12:15.900
Sophie-senpai broke her arm 
in church during prayers,

00:12:15.900 --> 00:12:19.910
and she couldn't cook, so here I am making 
everyone cry with my awesome cooking.

00:12:19.910 --> 00:12:20.710
Oh, yeah!

00:12:21.120 --> 00:12:22.730
Ah, good luck.

00:12:22.730 --> 00:12:23.750
Later.

00:12:24.730 --> 00:12:27.100
I guess it's just the two of us.

00:12:27.730 --> 00:12:29.120
Let's go, then.

00:12:29.500 --> 00:12:30.600
Okay.

00:12:40.340 --> 00:12:42.610
It's not like you're escorting a prisoner.

00:12:53.620 --> 00:12:55.790
Do you like WacDonald's?

00:12:56.240 --> 00:12:58.460
I've never had it.

00:12:59.840 --> 00:13:01.190
Do you want to?

00:13:01.600 --> 00:13:03.470
If that's what you wish.

00:13:15.780 --> 00:13:17.690
Your thoughts?

00:13:18.420 --> 00:13:20.430
It has a blunt taste.

00:13:20.430 --> 00:13:23.240
I think it warrants amazement.

00:13:23.240 --> 00:13:24.290
Oh.

00:13:24.290 --> 00:13:27.700
I heard WacDonald's is popular in Russia.

00:13:27.700 --> 00:13:28.650
Yes.

00:13:28.650 --> 00:13:32.700
I've never had time to stand 
in line, so I never went.

00:13:33.220 --> 00:13:34.950
You were that busy, huh?

00:13:35.440 --> 00:13:38.320
What's school like at the Russia branch?

00:13:38.320 --> 00:13:40.210
There is no school.

00:13:40.830 --> 00:13:44.720
The Russia branch raises 
Saviors military style.

00:13:45.650 --> 00:13:49.080
Training is rough, 
and we're sent to action early.

00:13:56.770 --> 00:14:00.590
If it's okay with you, 
let's hang out more in the future.

00:14:00.590 --> 00:14:03.090
Are you asking me out on dates?

00:14:03.090 --> 00:14:04.440
Yeah.

00:14:04.440 --> 00:14:05.990
I know a lot of friendly people.

00:14:06.270 --> 00:14:08.190
I'll introduce them to you.

00:14:09.940 --> 00:14:10.800
What's wrong?

00:14:11.190 --> 00:14:16.010
Don't you suspect me of being an 
assassin from Russia or something?

00:14:17.980 --> 00:14:20.760
Do you plan to kill me, Lesya?

00:14:22.350 --> 00:14:23.630
I don't.

00:14:24.710 --> 00:14:26.130
Then it's fine.

00:14:29.340 --> 00:14:31.010
He's so resolute.

00:14:31.010 --> 00:14:31.960
Huh?

00:14:32.460 --> 00:14:36.720
Watching you, I'm reminded of 
someone I met a long time ago.

00:14:37.380 --> 00:14:39.690
Is there someone that's like me?

00:14:40.220 --> 00:14:41.520
The UK branch executive.

00:14:41.520 --> 00:14:42.630
Please, no!

00:14:43.640 --> 00:14:46.030
Please stop being angry already.

00:14:46.460 --> 00:14:49.780
It's two in the morning 
here, you freaking brat!

00:14:50.160 --> 00:14:53.450
How could you say such nasty things?

00:14:53.450 --> 00:14:55.290
We're friends, aren't we?

00:14:56.190 --> 00:14:58.290
Who and who?

00:14:58.780 --> 00:15:02.250
Oh, but I looked up <i>everything</i> on

00:15:02.250 --> 00:15:06.170
Sir Edward because I saw my 
friend in so much distress.

00:15:07.170 --> 00:15:11.200
<i>Just because the Urushibara family 
has clout in Europe doesn't</i>

00:15:11.200 --> 00:15:13.880
<i>mean the investigation was easy.</i>

00:15:15.380 --> 00:15:16.540
Dammit!

00:15:17.650 --> 00:15:22.900
I'm told that Japanese couples always kiss 
when taking photos with this machine.

00:15:26.230 --> 00:15:27.560
Do you want one?

00:15:27.560 --> 00:15:31.270
I thought these machines were rigged 
so that you can never get the prizes.

00:15:31.860 --> 00:15:33.820
That's not true.

00:15:38.140 --> 00:15:39.290
For me?

00:15:39.720 --> 00:15:40.750
A gift.

00:15:41.260 --> 00:15:42.540
You wanted one, didn't you?

00:15:47.270 --> 00:15:51.120
All who live shall feel my wrath.

00:15:53.030 --> 00:15:54.650
Here it comes!

00:15:54.650 --> 00:15:59.160
Marisu-tan's Infinite Hell 
Attack, Ultimate Gehenna!

00:15:59.160 --> 00:16:02.340
Why do you know the names 
of the enemy's moves?

00:16:02.340 --> 00:16:05.160
Huh? I came up with this plot.

00:16:05.160 --> 00:16:06.690
You're the culprit again?!

00:16:07.030 --> 00:16:09.980
Listen to me, Nii-san, that skill was a

00:16:09.980 --> 00:16:15.950
forbidden Dark Magic that destroyed the 
seven worlds and turned them to hell.

00:16:15.950 --> 00:16:17.670
Quit rambling!

00:16:17.670 --> 00:16:19.410
We're the target here!

00:16:19.810 --> 00:16:24.920
<i>It could make minced meat 
out of Earth and then some!</i>

00:16:25.980 --> 00:16:28.420
<i>The arrogance of humanity 
has overtaken the earth.</i>

00:16:28.420 --> 00:16:30.920
<i>There is no more future.</i>

00:16:30.920 --> 00:16:32.530
<i>This is divine punishment.</i>

00:16:33.070 --> 00:16:36.480
<i>Saying that doesn't make it any better!</i>

00:16:36.480 --> 00:16:41.930
<i>I could go without food, just thinking 
about a last-day-on-earth plot.</i>

00:16:38.150 --> 00:16:39.880
And her details?

00:16:39.880 --> 00:16:41.930
<i>Her name is Elena Arshavina.</i>

00:16:42.490 --> 00:16:45.740
<i>A beautiful woman with steel-silver hair.</i>

00:16:45.740 --> 00:16:46.980
<i>About fifteen years old.</i>

00:16:46.980 --> 00:16:48.230
What?

00:16:48.720 --> 00:16:50.700
<i>Does that ring a bell?</i>

00:17:07.440 --> 00:17:10.460
<i>She might be a maneater.</i>

00:17:30.160 --> 00:17:31.330
Kept you waiting.

00:17:32.650 --> 00:17:33.780
Spasiba.

00:17:37.090 --> 00:17:38.740
This takes me back.

00:17:38.740 --> 00:17:41.590
I used to play catch with my uncle, too.

00:17:42.110 --> 00:17:43.540
Your uncle?

00:17:43.540 --> 00:17:45.210
Not your father?

00:17:46.760 --> 00:17:49.960
My dad died when I was little.

00:17:52.790 --> 00:17:54.640
Mom with him.

00:17:55.810 --> 00:17:58.590
We're the same in that sense, 
that we don't have parents.

00:18:01.160 --> 00:18:04.140
But I do have my uncle and aunt.

00:18:04.880 --> 00:18:06.920
And you have your younger brother.

00:18:06.920 --> 00:18:07.900
Right?

00:18:10.850 --> 00:18:13.940
My younger brother is always with me.

00:18:14.510 --> 00:18:15.520
Ah.

00:18:17.000 --> 00:18:19.560
I'd like to meet your brother someday.

00:18:21.940 --> 00:18:23.050
I understand.

00:18:24.020 --> 00:18:28.340
I'd like to meet your uncle 
and aunt when you do.

00:18:28.340 --> 00:18:30.460
Sure. That's a promise.

00:18:34.610 --> 00:18:37.920
Hehehehehe, you're doing well!

00:18:38.860 --> 00:18:41.170
Is this really how you want to do this, Condrat?

00:18:42.160 --> 00:18:47.300
Haimura is strong. Even with your ability.

00:18:47.790 --> 00:18:49.690
In order to ensure success,

00:18:50.270 --> 00:18:53.180
we must take advantage of his only weakness.

00:18:54.210 --> 00:18:58.060
Haimura Moroha is weak, 
when it comes to family.

00:18:59.510 --> 00:19:03.570
Focus only on seducing Haimura for now.

00:19:03.570 --> 00:19:06.780
You must become his weakness.

00:19:09.440 --> 00:19:10.820
I understand.

00:19:11.440 --> 00:19:13.670
I will put in a word to the Lightning Emperor

00:19:13.670 --> 00:19:17.170
so that you may spend time with your brother

00:19:17.420 --> 00:19:21.840
once this mission is complete.

00:19:22.950 --> 00:19:25.840
Thank you, Condrat.

00:19:39.070 --> 00:19:41.570
So you came, Elena-san.

00:19:43.180 --> 00:19:46.540
What is this about, Urushibara Shizuno?

00:19:47.160 --> 00:19:50.270
A love letter... or not.

00:19:50.760 --> 00:19:53.080
It's a letter of challenge.

00:19:53.080 --> 00:19:55.040
I'm requesting a duel.

00:19:56.530 --> 00:19:58.550
You intend to fight me?

00:19:59.370 --> 00:20:00.450
Yes.

00:20:00.450 --> 00:20:03.180
You're a maneater, aren't you?

00:20:03.960 --> 00:20:05.970
The Lightning Emperor's trump card.

00:20:06.650 --> 00:20:08.600
A Savior-killing Savior.

00:20:09.990 --> 00:20:11.860
You don't have to answer me.

00:20:12.280 --> 00:20:18.230
Either way, I can't allow you near Moroha.

00:20:27.700 --> 00:20:28.810
Write!

00:20:28.810 --> 00:20:31.380
<b>As water flows from high to low, take all life.</b>

00:20:32.110 --> 00:20:33.710
Freezing Shade!

00:20:50.320 --> 00:20:51.260
Again!

00:20:51.260 --> 00:20:52.690
Freezing Shade!

00:21:11.830 --> 00:21:14.250
Good job, Nagravitts.

00:21:15.540 --> 00:21:17.750
That staff... The Origin.

00:21:31.390 --> 00:21:32.430
Write!

00:21:35.960 --> 00:21:38.680
Sorry, Condrat.

00:21:39.210 --> 00:21:41.060
She's strong.

00:21:41.340 --> 00:21:43.880
I can't hide it any longer.

00:21:48.970 --> 00:21:50.330
Dreadful Blizzard!

00:21:59.690 --> 00:22:00.960
She absorbed it?

00:22:05.380 --> 00:22:09.970
If I die now, my brother will have no future.

00:22:12.680 --> 00:22:14.180
<b>With decisiveness!</b>

00:22:12.680 --> 00:22:14.270
With decisiveness!

00:22:17.630 --> 00:22:18.600
Lightning!

00:22:34.850 --> 00:22:39.250
A maneater's The Origin, 
the demon sword Replazan.

00:22:39.620 --> 00:22:42.000
I didn't expect it to be so much.

00:22:44.650 --> 00:22:47.740
You saw nothing today.

00:22:47.740 --> 00:22:52.380
And you will not stand between Haimura Moroha and me going forward.

00:22:53.140 --> 00:22:54.430
Promise.

00:22:55.180 --> 00:22:57.560
And if I break the promise?

00:22:58.440 --> 00:23:01.730
Next time, I will erase you.

00:23:01.730 --> 00:23:06.510
Such kind words, coming from a 
rabid dog from the Russia branch.

00:23:08.030 --> 00:23:08.900
Don't act tough.

00:23:13.830 --> 00:23:18.540
I'll leave a permanent scar on your 
beautiful face to teach you a lesson.

00:23:19.550 --> 00:23:24.550
A deep scar, so you couldn't 
show yourself to Haimura Moroha.

00:23:28.040 --> 00:23:32.020
Do it, if that'll make you content.

00:23:32.020 --> 00:23:37.560
Moroha wouldn't hate me just 
because I have a scar on my face.

00:23:44.370 --> 00:23:45.460
What do you think you're doing?

00:23:46.520 --> 00:23:48.570
Saviors are banned from fighting each other!

00:23:57.050 --> 00:24:03.450
<i>The heart of the so-called maneater girl 
is as dark and piercing as obsidian.</i>

00:24:03.950 --> 00:24:10.940
<i>But Shizuno-oneesan was certain 
she could feel it wavering.</i>

00:24:14.930 --> 00:24:24.810
<b>Preview</b>

00:24:15.390 --> 00:24:17.670
Takkie-senpai, that move 
was seriously awesome!

00:24:17.670 --> 00:24:18.580
Nah, it was nothing.

00:24:18.580 --> 00:24:21.360
You stripped a girl naked! Total respect!

00:24:21.360 --> 00:24:23.430
Next time, episode eight: 
"The Demon Sword and the Holy Sword."

00:24:23.430 --> 00:24:25.070
Come, Saratiga!
